::setContext","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_setContext","d":"<p>sets the default query cotext</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::getContext","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_getContext","d":"<p>retrieve the default query context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::each","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_each","d":"<p>executes a callback for each result\nif $callback is closure $this is the current DOMElement</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::all","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_all","d":"<p>executes a callback with paramaters $this-&gt;results\nif $callback is closure $this is the CommonXml object that filter methods belongs to</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::check","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_check","d":"<p>Stores a callback that text() consults before writing.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::filter","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_filter","d":"<p>reduces results to the ones that pass the test of the $callback;\n$callback returns TRUE to keep the element;\n$callback can be either function, lambda or closure\n$callback only argument is current result\nif $callback is closure $this is the CommonXml object that filter methods belongs to</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::find","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_find","d":"<p>executes the given callback for all nodes given by selector in the context of each Xml::results\nif callback is closure $this is the current DOMElement</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::has","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_has","d":"<p>filters the results with the ones having elements to match the given @$selector</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::get","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_get","d":"<p>retrieve the $index element of the results\nif $callback is given run it for the $index element of the results and return $this</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::is","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_is","d":"<p>find if current node is matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::descendantsAndSelf","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_descendantsAndSelf","d":"<p>find any descendants or self matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::descendants","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_descendants","d":"<p>find any descendants matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::parentsAndSelf","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_parentsAndSelf","d":"<p>find parent nodes, including self, matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::parents","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_parents","d":"<p>find parent nodes matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::children","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_children","d":"<p>find child nodes matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::following","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_following","d":"<p>find following nodes matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::preceding","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_preceding","d":"<p>find preceding nodes matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::attribute","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_attribute","d":"<p>find the attribute nodes matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::next","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_next","d":"<p>find next siblings matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::prev","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_prev","d":"<p>find prev siblings matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::siblings","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_siblings","d":"<p>find siblings matching given selector; if a callback is provided, run it for each result, otherwise commit changes in CommonXml::results\napplies to CommonXml::results and not CommonXml::context</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::add","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_add","d":"<p>adds the  results  of xpath query for selector to existing set of results</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::prop","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_prop","d":"<p>changes a native property of DOMNode if possible, for each results</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::hasClass","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_hasClass","d":"<p>filters the results to the ones having given class</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::removeClass","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_removeClass","d":"<p>removes given class</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::addClass","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_addClass","d":"<p>adds given class</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::attr","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_attr","d":"<p>returns class instance for 2 arguments or attr value for one argument (attr name)</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::removeAttr","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_removeAttr","d":"<p>removes given attribute</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::removeAttributes","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_removeAttributes","d":"<p>removes all atributes</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::normalizeOperationsInput","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_normalizeOperationsInput","d":"<p>creates an array of DOMNodes</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::cloneResults","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_cloneResults","d":"<p>clones all nodes in results</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::append","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_append","d":"<p>appends to all nodes in results</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::prepend","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_prepend","d":"<p>prepends to all nodes in results</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::before","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_before","d":"<p>inserts before all nodes in results</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::after","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_after","d":"<p>inserts after all nodes in results</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::replace","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_replace","d":"<p>replaces all nodes in results</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::replaceContent","p":"Xms/Core/CommonXml.html#method_replaceContent","d":"<p>replaces content of all nodes in results</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\CommonXml::removeChilds","