re\\Directive::__invoke","p":"Xms/Core/Directive.html#method___invoke","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Directive::getDirectiveHandler","p":"Xms/Core/Directive.html#method_getDirectiveHandler","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Directive::isDirective","p":"Xms/Core/Directive.html#method_isDirective","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::topmost","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_topmost","d":"<p>get the highest level parent node</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::closest","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_closest","d":"<p>find first parent not DOMNode nor XmsDomDocument</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::respondsToEvent","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_respondsToEvent","d":"<p>check if this object is having a callback associated with $type event</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::getEventCallback","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_getEventCallback","d":"<p>get the callback associated with an event</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::getEventCallbacks_on","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_getEventCallbacks_on","d":"<p>get an array of callback for BEFORE/after of an event</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::trigger","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_trigger","d":"<p>triggers an event on this object\nif this object doesn't have an $action type event, it creates one, with no callback\nso that the event is bubbled accordong to $bubble type\nEx\nDefault bubbling type child-&gt;parent</p>\n<ol>\n<li>$someXmsDomElement -&gt; trigger(&quot;anEvent&quot;, array(&quot;USER DATA&quot;));</li>\n<li>$someXmsDomElement -&gt; trigger(&quot;anEvent&quot;, array(&quot;USER DATA&quot;), XmsEvent::BUBBLE_PARENT);</li>\n</ol>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::on","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_on","d":"<p>creates an event type $action with an $callback associated with this object to execute when the event is triggered\nOR\ncreates before/after callback to execute before or after event's callback\nEx:\n$this -&gt; on(&quot;someEvent&quot;, function($evt) {\n//this is the object instance of XmsDomElement\n//$evt is the event instance of XmsDomEvent\n});\n$this -&gt; on(&quot;before&quot;, &quot;someEvent&quot;, function($evt) {\n//$evt and $this instance of XmsDomEvent\n});</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::touch","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_touch","d":"<p>NOT IMPLEMENTED</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::detachEventHandler","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_detachEventHandler","d":"<p>removes an event handler (callback) of this object</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\EventHandlerPredefinedMethods::detachAllEventHandlers","p":"Xms/Core/EventHandlerPredefinedMethods.html#method_detachAllEventHandlers","d":"<p>removes all event handlers (callbacks) of this object</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Html::__construct","p":"Xms/Core/Html.html#method___construct","d":"constructor"},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Html::content","p":"Xms/Core/Html.html#method_content","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Html::body","p":"Xms/Core/Html.html#method_body","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Html::head","p":"Xms/Core/Html.html#method_head","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Html::getScripts","p":"Xms/Core/Html.html#method_getScripts","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Html::getLinks","p":"Xms/Core/Html.html#method_getLinks","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Html::getStyles","p":"Xms/Core/Html.html#method_getStyles","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Html::bodyContent","p":"Xms/Core/Html.html#method_bodyContent","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"Xms\\Core\\Html::headContent","p":"Xms/Core/Html.html#method_headContent","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"